# HN Radio job, twice a day: 3:00 AM and 3:00 PM Pacific (DST-aware via CRON_TZ). Each run
# generates an episode from the last 18 hours of the front page (config.LOOKBACK_HOURS) straight
# onto the volume, verifies it, and re-runs a bad take once. daily.py rebuilds the feed; the
# running server serves it immediately.
CRON_TZ=America/Los_Angeles
#
# The interpreter is the synced venv's, spelled absolutely. supercronic does pass the container's
# PATH down, so a bare `python` would resolve too -- but this job runs unattended, and the
# failure mode of picking up the image's bare /usr/local/bin/python is an ImportError in a log
# nobody reads until the feed is a day stale.
0 3,15 * * * cd /app && /app/.venv/bin/python scripts/daily.py >> /data/cron.log 2>&1
